<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0pt; text-indent: 0.25in">The
Company has one operating lease pertaining to 5,969 square feet of corporate office space in Sugar Land, Texas pursuant to a lease agreement
that commenced April&nbsp;1, 2022. As of December&nbsp;31, 2024 the remaining term of lease was 2.58 years. The lease requires monthly
lease payments that are subject to annual increases throughout the lease term.</P>

