<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0pt"><B>12. Income Taxes</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0pt; text-indent: 0.25in">During the years ended
December&nbsp;31, 2024 and 2023, the Company did not record a provision for income taxes because it has incurred net operating losses
since inception and maintains a full valuation allowance against its deferred tax assets. The Company&rsquo;s entire pre-tax loss for
the years ended December&nbsp;31, 2024 and 2023 were from U.S. operations and resulted in no tax expense or benefit.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0pt; text-indent: 0.25in">A reconciliation of
